#
# Fail-witness for ex:saConfidenceIsNotProbabilistic: it declares gmeow:confidence an instance
# of the probabilistic framework, the conflation of an asserter's confidence with a probability
# over a declared model. Unioned with the provenance module by the gmeow:saFailWitness teeth
# check, it makes the ban's ASK hold, proving the ban catches the declaration rather than passing
# vacuously. The real module must never carry this triple.
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .

gmeow:confidence logic:instantiatesFramework logic:ProbabilisticFramework .
